#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples in this section illustrate some common ways to use the Executor"
" primitive. Before running these examples, follow the instructions in "
"[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) and [Executor "
"quickstart](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh-contoh di bagian ini mengilustrasikan beberapa cara umum menggunakan "
"primitif Executor. Sebelum menjalankan contoh-contoh ini, ikuti instruksi di"
" [Instal Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) dan [Quickstart "
"Executor](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some of the code examples on this page use `samplex`, which is part of the "
"Samplomatic package.  Therefore, before running those code block, you must "
"install Samplomatic, as shown in the following code block.  For more "
"information, see the [Samplomatic "
"documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa contoh kode di halaman ini menggunakan `samplex`, yang merupakan "
"bagian dari paket Samplomatic. Oleh karena itu, sebelum menjalankan blok "
"kode tersebut, Anda harus menginstal Samplomatic, seperti yang ditunjukkan "
"dalam blok kode berikut. Untuk info lebih lanjut, lihat [dokumentasi "
"Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Parameterized circuit {#example-parameterized-circuit}"
msgstr "Contoh: Sirkuit berparameter {#example-parameterized-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example illustrates how to add circuit items with parameters, as well as how to add samplex items. It consists of these steps:\n"
"1. Set up the circuit: Generate and transpile the target circuit.\n"
"2. Prepare a samplex: Group gates and measurements into annotated boxes and generate the circuit template and samplex pair.\n"
"3. Execute: Add a circuit item and a samplex item to a `QuantumProgram` and execute both in a single job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini mengilustrasikan cara menambahkan item sirkuit dengan parameter, serta cara menambahkan item samplex. Terdiri dari langkah-langkah berikut:\n"
"1. Siapkan sirkuit: Hasilkan dan transpile sirkuit target.\n"
"2. Siapkan samplex: Kelompokkan gate dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak beranotasi dan hasilkan pasangan template sirkuit dan samplex.\n"
"3. Eksekusi: Tambahkan item sirkuit dan item samplex ke `QuantumProgram` dan eksekusi keduanya dalam satu job.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the circuit {#set-up-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Siapkan sirkuit {#set-up-the-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prepare a three-qubit GHZ state, rotate the qubits around the Pauli-Z axis, "
"and measures the qubits in the computational basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siapkan state GHZ tiga qubit, rotasi qubit di sekitar sumbu Pauli-Z, dan "
"ukur qubit dalam basis komputasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Specify the backend and transpile the circuit to only use instructions "
"supported by the QPU (referred to as an instruction set architecture (ISA) "
"circuit).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan Backend dan transpile sirkuit agar hanya menggunakan instruksi yang"
" didukung oleh QPU (disebut sebagai sirkuit instruction set architecture "
"(ISA)).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the samplex {#prepare-the-samplex}"
msgstr "Siapkan samplex {#prepare-the-samplex}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` convenience function and its twirling"
" parameters to group two-qubit gates and measurements into boxes and apply "
"twirling annotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan fungsi kemudahan `generate_boxing_pass_manager` dan parameter "
"twirling-nya untuk mengelompokkan gate dua qubit dan pengukuran ke dalam "
"kotak dan menerapkan anotasi twirling.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `build` method to generate the template circuit and the samplex.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan metode `build` untuk menghasilkan template sirkuit dan samplex.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuits {#execute-the-circuits}"
msgstr "Eksekusi sirkuit {#execute-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Executor runs `QuantumProgram` objects. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain "
"several items. This example adds a circuit item and a samplex item for "
"execution. For full details, see [Executor input and "
"output](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"
msgstr ""
"Executor menjalankan objek `QuantumProgram`. Setiap `QuantumProgram` bisa "
"mengandung beberapa item. Contoh ini menambahkan item sirkuit dan item "
"samplex untuk dieksekusi. Untuk detail lengkap, lihat [Input dan output "
"Executor](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first step is to initialize an empty program, requesting `1024` shots "
"for each configuration of each item.\n"
msgstr ""
"Langkah pertama adalah menginisialisasi program kosong, meminta `1024` shots"
" untuk setiap konfigurasi dari setiap item.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Append the circuit item to the `QuantumProgram`. This circuit item consists "
"of two parts - the ISA circuit and 10 sets of its parameter values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan item sirkuit ke `QuantumProgram`. Item sirkuit ini terdiri dari "
"dua bagian - sirkuit ISA dan 10 set nilai parameternya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Append the samplex item to the `QuantumProgram` with these arguments:\n"
"- The template circuit and the samplex generated by the `build` function\n"
"- Ten sets of parameter values for the original circuit\n"
"- The number of randomizations to perform\n"
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan item samplex ke `QuantumProgram` dengan argumen-argumen ini:\n"
"- Template sirkuit dan samplex yang dihasilkan oleh fungsi `build`\n"
"- Sepuluh set nilai parameter untuk sirkuit asli\n"
"- Jumlah randomisasi yang akan dilakukan\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Executor job {#run-the-executor-job}"
msgstr "Jalankan job Executor {#run-the-executor-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the result for each task.\n"
msgstr "Ambil hasil untuk setiap tugas.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Perform PEC {#example-perform-pec}"
msgstr "Contoh: Lakukan PEC {#example-perform-pec}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example shows how to use a samplex item to perform probabilistic error "
"cancellation ([PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#pec)) for error mitigation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan item samplex untuk melakukan "
"probabilistic error cancellation ([PEC](/guides/error-mitigation-and-"
"suppression-techniques#pec)) untuk mitigasi error.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider a mirrored-version of a circuit with ten qubits and two unique layers of CX gates. These are the main tasks:\n"
"- Execute the circuit with twirling.\n"
"- Execute the circuit with PEC mitigation, as in the paper [\"Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangkan versi mirrored dari sirkuit dengan sepuluh qubit dan dua layer unik gate CX. Ini adalah tugas-tugas utamanya:\n"
"- Eksekusi sirkuit dengan twirling.\n"
"- Eksekusi sirkuit dengan mitigasi PEC, seperti dalam paper [\"Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The pipeline consists of these steps:\n"
"1. Set up: Generate the target circuit and group its operations into boxes.\n"
"2. Learn: Learn the noise of the instructions that we want to mitigate with PEC.\n"
"3. Execute: Run the circuit on a backend.\n"
"4. Analyze: Post-process and analyze the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pipeline terdiri dari langkah-langkah berikut:\n"
"1. Siapkan: Hasilkan sirkuit target dan kelompokkan operasinya ke dalam kotak.\n"
"2. Pelajari: Pelajari noise dari instruksi yang ingin kita mitigasi dengan PEC.\n"
"3. Eksekusi: Jalankan sirkuit pada Backend.\n"
"4. Analisis: Post-process dan analisis hasilnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For comparison, we will run this mirrored circuit twice. Once with only "
"Pauli-twirling applied, and once withe PEC mitigation applied.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk perbandingan, kita akan menjalankan sirkuit mirrored ini dua kali. "
"Sekali hanya dengan Pauli-twirling yang diterapkan, dan sekali dengan "
"mitigasi PEC yang diterapkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The usage for this example is approximately 10 minutes on a Heron r2 processor.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Penggunaan untuk contoh ini adalah sekitar 10 menit pada prosesor Heron r2.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the circuit {#set-up-the-circuit-1}"
msgstr "Siapkan sirkuit {#set-up-the-circuit-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend and prepare a 10-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr "Pilih Backend dan siapkan sirkuit 10 qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-"
"examples/extracted-outputs/f9e93b2c-154a-4d09-872d-f770bcc669c4-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-"
"examples/extracted-outputs/f9e93b2c-154a-4d09-872d-f770bcc669c4-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Combine the circuit with its inverse to create a mirror circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gabungkan sirkuit dengan inversnya untuk membuat sirkuit mirror.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-"
"examples/extracted-outputs/f8ac3f75-88ca-40f9-8382-6a427303bb8e-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/executor-"
"examples/extracted-outputs/f8ac3f75-88ca-40f9-8382-6a427303bb8e-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set some parameter values:\n"
msgstr "Atur beberapa nilai parameter:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the pass manager to transpile the circuit to become an ISA circuit.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan pass manager untuk mentranspile sirkuit menjadi sirkuit ISA.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, group gates and measurements into annotated boxes. You can do this "
"manually or use the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` function from Samplomatic"
" for convenience. The first circuit will only have twirling applied and "
"therefore only needs the `Twirl` annotation. The second circuit will be run "
"with full PEC mitigation and needs both `Twirl` and `InjectNoise` "
"annotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, kelompokkan gate dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak beranotasi. Kamu"
" bisa melakukan ini secara manual atau menggunakan fungsi "
"`generate_boxing_pass_manager` dari Samplomatic untuk kemudahan. Sirkuit "
"pertama hanya akan memiliki twirling yang diterapkan dan oleh karena itu "
"hanya memerlukan anotasi `Twirl`. Sirkuit kedua akan dijalankan dengan "
"mitigasi PEC penuh dan memerlukan anotasi `Twirl` dan `InjectNoise`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise {#learn-the-noise}"
msgstr "Pelajari noise {#learn-the-noise}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To minimize the number of noise learning experiments, identify the unique instructions in the second circuit (the one with boxes annotated with `InjectNoise`). In defining uniqueness, two box instructions are equal if both of the following are true:\n"
"- Their content is equal, up to single-qubit gates.\n"
"- Their `Twirl` annotation is equal (every other annotation is disregarded).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk meminimalkan jumlah eksperimen pembelajaran noise, identifikasi instruksi unik dalam sirkuit kedua (yang memiliki kotak beranotasi `InjectNoise`). Dalam mendefinisikan keunikan, dua instruksi kotak sama jika keduanya benar:\n"
"- Kontennya sama, hingga gate satu qubit.\n"
"- Anotasi `Twirl` mereka sama (setiap anotasi lain diabaikan).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This leads to three unique instructions, namely the odd and even gate boxes,"
" and the final measurement box.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini menghasilkan tiga instruksi unik, yaitu kotak gate ganjil dan genap, dan"
" kotak pengukuran akhir.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize a `NoiseLearnerV3`, choose the learning parameters by setting its"
" options, and run a noise learning job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inisialisasi `NoiseLearnerV3`, pilih parameter pembelajaran dengan mengatur "
"opsinya, dan jalankan job pembelajaran noise.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Convert `result` to the object required by the samplex by using the "
"`result.to_dict` method.\n"
msgstr ""
"Konversi `result` ke objek yang diperlukan oleh samplex menggunakan metode "
"`result.to_dict`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the circuits {#execute-the-circuits-1}"
msgstr "Eksekusi sirkuit {#execute-the-circuits-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Executor` runs `QuantumProgram` objects. Each `QuantumProgram` can contain "
"several *items*, which are appended to the program. Each item is a task for "
"the program to perform.\n"
msgstr ""
"`Executor` menjalankan objek `QuantumProgram`. Setiap `QuantumProgram` bisa "
"mengandung beberapa *item*, yang ditambahkan ke program. Setiap item adalah "
"tugas yang harus dilakukan program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize an empty program, requesting `1000` shots for each configuration "
"of each item.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inisialisasi program kosong, meminta `1000` shots untuk setiap konfigurasi "
"dari setiap item.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, build the template circuit and samplex for `mirror_circuit_twirl` and "
"append them to the program. Also request `900` randomizations from the "
"samplex. This means that the samplex will generate `900` sets of parameters,"
" and each set will be executed `1000` times (the number of shots) in the "
"QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, bangun template sirkuit dan samplex untuk "
"`mirror_circuit_twirl` dan tambahkan ke program. Juga minta `900` "
"randomisasi dari samplex. Ini berarti samplex akan menghasilkan `900` set "
"parameter, dan setiap set akan dieksekusi `1000` kali (jumlah shots) di "
"QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This is the program's first task (result 0).\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah tugas pertama program (hasil 0).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Similarly, append the template circuit and samplex built for "
"`mirror_circuit_pec`, requesting `900` randomizations.  This is the "
"program's second task (result 1).\n"
msgstr ""
"Demikian pula, tambahkan template sirkuit dan samplex yang dibangun untuk "
"`mirror_circuit_pec`, meminta `900` randomisasi. Ini adalah tugas kedua "
"program (hasil 1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import `Executor` and submit a job.\n"
msgstr "Import `Executor` dan kirimkan job.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze results {#analyze-results}"
msgstr "Analisis hasil {#analyze-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, post-process the results to estimate the expectation values of "
"single-qubit Pauli-Z operators acting on each of the ten active qubits "
"(expected value: `1.0`).\n"
msgstr ""
"Terakhir, post-process hasilnya untuk memperkirakan nilai ekspektasi "
"operator Pauli-Z satu qubit yang bertindak pada masing-masing dari sepuluh "
"qubit aktif (nilai yang diharapkan: `1.0`).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
