"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Tinjau gambaran umum [broadcasting](/guides/primitive-input-output#broadcasting).\n"
"- Pelajari cara menggunakan [opsi Executor](/guides/executor-options).\n"
"- Pahami [model eksekusi terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"- Tinjau [dokumentasi Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/).\n"
"- Pelajari cara menggabungkan teknik mitigasi error yang berbeda saat menggunakan model eksekusi terarah dalam tutorial [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
